# Q47 What is affected if this table or system changes: for each system, the tables that copy its data and every data object built from them; for each table, every data object built from it; with the measures those compute and the agents bound to them.
PREFIX tg: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/technical-graph/>
SELECT ?changed ?affected ?measure ?agent WHERE {
  { ?database tg:standsFor ?changed . ?start tg:copies ?database . ?affected tg:readsFrom* ?start . }
  UNION
  { ?changed a tg:Table . ?affected tg:readsFrom+ ?changed . }
  OPTIONAL { ?affected tg:implements ?measure }
  OPTIONAL { ?agent tg:binds ?affected }
}
